  "chapter": {
    "bookTitle": "Psalms",
    "delineation": "Psalm",
    "number": 130,
    "summary": "O Lord, hear our prayers, forgive iniquity, and redeem Israel.",
    "chapterAugmentations": [],
    "verses": [
      {
        "text": "Out of the depths have I cried unto thee, O Lord.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 11,
            "end": 17,
            "text": "Ps. 69:2."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Lord, hear my voice: let thine ears be attentive to the voice of my supplications.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "If thou, Lord, shouldest mark iniquities, O Lord, who shall stand?",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 30,
            "end": 40,
            "text": "Ps. 90:8."
          },
          {
            "start": 60,
            "end": 65,
            "text": "Ps. 76:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "But there is forgiveness with thee, that thou mayest be feared.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 24,
            "text": "TG Forgive."
          },
          {
            "start": 56,
            "end": 62,
            "text": "1 Kgs. 8:40 (39–40)."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 4,
            "end": 12
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "I wait for the Lord, my soul doth wait, and in his word do I hope.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 2,
            "end": 10,
            "text": "Ps. 40:1."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "My soul waiteth for the Lord more than they that watch for the morning: I say, more than they that watch for the morning.",
        "footNotes": [],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 8,
            "end": 15
          },
          {
            "start": 72,
            "end": 88
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "Let Israel hope in the Lord: for with the Lord there is mercy, and with him is plenteous redemption.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 89,
            "end": 99,
            "text": "Isa. 55:7."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [
          {
            "start": 47,
            "end": 55
          },
          {
            "start": 76,
            "end": 78
          }
        ],
        "associatedContent": []
      },
      {
        "text": "And he shall redeem Israel from all his iniquities.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 13,
            "end": 19,
            "text": "Ps. 25:22."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": []
      }
    ]
  },
